Tumhara ek wholesale business hai jahan teen tarah ke buyers aate hain:

Customer Group	Kaun hote hain	Discount level
Retailer	Chhoti dukaan wale, kam quantity lete hain	Sabse kam discount
Distributor	Medium quantity, regular orders	Medium discount
Wholesaler	Bulk quantity, bade order	Sabse zyada discount
Kaam kaise karta hai (product_price_tiers ke sath milke):

Ek hi product ka price alag-alag hoga depending on:

Kaun khareed raha hai (customer_group_id)
Kitni quantity le raha hai (min_qty / max_qty)

Example — ek Shirt (base price ₹699) ka pricing:

Customer Group	Min Qty	Max Qty	Price
Retailer	1	9	₹699
Retailer	10	49	₹650
Distributor	1	49	₹600
Wholesaler	50	∞	₹550